  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financial Monitoring Danida Fellowship Centre 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Given the complexity of the organisation, combined with the expanded scope of the monitoring visit, which will also include a follow-up on the 2022 review, support from an external financial consultant is required.  

The objective of the assignment is to provide technical support and expertise in the area of financial management and compliance for an assessment of the adequacy, transparency and quality of the financial management set-up, systems and procedures at DFC.</narrative>
  </description>
